{"id":"dadbe463a5c99c0a","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-substitution-frege.md","title":"Substitution Frege System","display":"df-substitution-frege — Substitution Frege System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-substitution-frege","aliases":["72-df-substitution-frege"],"display":"df-substitution-frege — Substitution Frege System","depends_on":["[[72-df-frege-system]]","[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 8.1.3 and Definition 8.1.4; printed p. 591; PDF p. 603","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-substitution-frege"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-substitution-frege</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-frege — Substitution Frege System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f35aac82e2971e68\" href=\"?note=f35aac82e2971e68\" title=\"72-df-frege-system\">72-df-frege-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 8.1.3 and Definition 8.1.4; printed p. 591; PDF p. 603"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Frege}(R)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f35aac82e2971e68\" href=\"?note=f35aac82e2971e68\" title=\"72-df-frege-system\">72-df-frege-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SF}_R\\vdash\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{SF}_R\\vdash\\tau\\)</span> 是 Assertion 定义的代入 Frege 定理关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Step}_R(\\{\\pi_j:j&lt;i\\},\\pi_i)\n\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}\\;(\\pi_i=\\widehat\\sigma(\\pi_j))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)&gt;0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Step}_R(\\{\\pi_j:j&lt;i\\},\\pi_i)\n\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}\\;(\\pi_i=\\widehat\\sigma(\\pi_j))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SF}_R\\vdash\\tau\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SF}_R\\vdash\\tau\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，§8.1.3–Definition 8.1.4，印刷页 591，PDF 页 603；新节点把普通规则模式中的同时代入与对已经推出公式的代入规则分开。</li>\n<li>此处只定义无额外假设的 substitution Frege 证明。不能对带有未同时代入的外部假设任意施行这一规则并仍保持相同假设集。</li>\n<li>已比较原书定义；可靠性由重言式在同时代入下保持有效以及 Frege 规则可靠性按证明行归纳推出，没有断言代入可被普通 Frege 多项式模拟。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-frege-system","status":"resolved","id":"f35aac82e2971e68","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-frege-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-frege-system","status":"resolved","id":"f35aac82e2971e68","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$ 及 $\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 如 [[72-df-frege-system]]；$\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$ 及 $\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 如 [[72-df-frege-system]]；$\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Frege}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Fml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SF}_R\\vdash\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;&\n\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)>0\\land\\pi_{\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)-1}=\\tau\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Step}_R(\\{\\pi_j:j<i\\},\\pi_i)\n\\lor\\exists j<i\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}\\;(\\pi_i=\\widehat\\sigma(\\pi_j))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SF}_R\\vdash\\tau\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{<\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{SFProof}(R,\\pi,\\tau).","display":true}],"bytes":2092,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-349","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-substitution-frege|df-substitution-frege — Substitution Frege System]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-347","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-substitution-frege — Substitution Frege System](72-df-substitution-frege.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-375","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-substitution-frege|df-substitution-frege — Substitution Frege System]]"},{"id":"b07cf6e91885e3f6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],